#: lumos.core.param:21 of
msgid ""
"the **SI value**, a float, complex or read-only array in unscaled SI "
"units, returned by :meth:`ParamHost.si` for the numerical kernels."
msgstr ""

#: lumos.core.param:24 of
msgid ""
"Arrays are copied on assignment and stored read-only, so they cannot be "
"modified behind the host's back: every change goes through an assignment,"
" which calls :meth:`ParamHost._on_field_changed` (used to invalidate "
"cached results)."
