#: lumos.core.param.Setting:1 of
msgid ""
"A non-physical setting: an integer, a float without unit, a string or a "
"boolean."
msgstr ""

#: lumos.core.param.Setting:3 of
msgid ""
"Expected Python type. Booleans are not accepted for ``int`` or ``float`` "
