#: lumos.core.element:1 of
msgid ""
"Base class of every LUMOS element: equipment, optical component, detector"
" or processing block."
msgstr ""

#: lumos.core.element:3 of
msgid ""
"An element declares its fields (:class:`~lumos.core.param.Param`, "
":class:`~lumos.core.param.State`, :class:`~lumos.core.param.Setting`) and"
" its ports (:class:`~lumos.core.port.Input`, "
":class:`~lumos.core.port.Output`) as class attributes, and implements its"
" behaviour as a **pure** transfer function::"
msgstr ""

#: lumos.core.element:19 of
msgid ""
"``transfer`` must be a ``staticmethod``: it cannot read or modify the "
"element itself. It receives an immutable snapshot of the SI values of all"
" fields (:class:`Values`) and the input signals by port name, and returns"
" the output signals by port name. This separation between the element's "
"state and its computation is what allows JIT compilation, vectorisation "
"and automatic differentiation (ADR-0002)."
